ison</surname><given-names>CT</given-names></name><name><surname>Levine</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Cole</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Hannett</surname><given-names>NM</given-names></name><name><surname>Lee</surname><given-names>TI</given-names></name><name><surname>Bell</surname><given-names>GW</given-names></name><name><surname>Walker</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Rolfe</surname><given-names>PA</given-names></name><name><surname>Herbolsheimer</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><etal></etal></person-group><article-title>Genome-wide map of nucleosome acetylation and methylation in yeast.</article-title><source>Cell</source><year>2005</year><volume>122</volume><fpage>517</fpage><lpage>527</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16122420</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.cell.2005.06.026</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Simpson</surname><given-names>RT</given-names></name></person-group><article-title><italic>In vivo </italic>methods to analyze chromatin structure.</article-title><source>Curr Opin Genet Dev</source><year>1999</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>225</fpage><lpage>229</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10322144</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0959-437X(99)80033-1</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Satchwell</surname><given-names>SC</given-names></name><name><surname>Drew</surname><given-names>HR</given-names></name><name><surname>Travers</surname><given-names>AA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Sequence periodicities in chicken nucleosome core DNA.</article-title><source>J Mol Biol</source><year>1986</year><volume>191</volume><fpage>659</fpage><lpage>675</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3806678</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/0022-2836(86)90452-3</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Segal</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Fondufe-Mittendorf</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Chen</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Thastrom</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Field</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Moore</surname><given-names>IK</given-names></name><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name><name><surname>Widom</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A genomic code for nucleosome positioning.</article-title><source>Nature</source><year>2006</year><volume>442</volume><fpage>772</fpage><lpage>778</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16862119</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/nature04979</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Whitehouse</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Tsukiyama</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Antagonistic forces that position nucleosomes <italic>in vivo</italic>.</article-title><source>Nat Struct Mol Biol</source><year>2006</year><volume>13</volume><fpage>633</fpage><lpage>640</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16819518</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/nsmb1111</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Shendure</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Porreca</surname><given-names>GJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Reppas</surname><given-names>NB</given-names></name><name><surname>Lin</surname><given-names>X</given-names></name><name><surname>McCutcheon</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name><name><surname>Rosenbaum</surname><given-names>AM<